  "body": "Imagine starting every morning with a stroll down to the water...\r\n\r\nSituated a mere 50 metres from the pristine shores of Little Manly Beach, this property is the ultimate blank slate for sun-seekers, water sports enthusiasts, and anyone craving a relaxed, permanent coastal holiday lifestyle.\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------\r\nAN UNMISSABLE URGENT SALE \r\n------------------------------------------\r\nThe vendors are incredibly motivated and their instructions are crystal clear: this property MUST BE SOLD immediately. Throw out the CV and forget expectations-this is strictly about securing unparalleled beachside value.\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------\r\nLIMITLESS COASTAL POTENTIAL \r\n------------------------------------------\r\nPositioned directly across from the scenic Sundown Reserve, this incredibly rare 1212 sqm flat section offers a massive footprint to bring your vision to life:\r\n\r\n*\tRENOVATE: Bring your tools and transform the existing 157sqm; home into a modern, bespoke seaside retreat.\r\n\r\n*\tREBUILD: Clear the section and design the sprawling, luxury coastal estate you've always dreamed of from the ground up.\r\n\r\n\r\nProperties offering land this generous, this close to the sand, disappear in an absolute flash. Don't let someone else steal your beachside dream-act right now!\r\n\r\nALL CONJUNCTIONALS WELCOME, so agents, bring your buyers! \r\n\r\nContact Ian 0211592078 today to find out more!",
